  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint Programme for Gender Equality (JPGE) - Gender Programme</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">J&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhets Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">JPGE &#xe4;r ett program som f&#xf6;r samman FN organisationer och den          Zimbabwiska staten f&#xf6;r att st&#xf6;dja Zimbabwe att n&#xe5; millenium m&#xe5;l 3.    Programmet fokuserar p&#xe5; att skapa en fr&#xe4;mjande milj&#xf6; f&#xf6;r att &#xf6;ka      j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldheten mellan m&#xe4;n och kvinnor i Zimbabwe samt att h&#xe5;lla den   Zimbabwiska staten ansvarig f&#xf6;r att fr&#xe4;mja j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet i landet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The JPGE will bring together state, UN development agencies,          development partners and a number of different gender equality        advocates to support the Government of Zimbabwe in attaining its      development goals (of which MDG 3 on Gender Equality is one)..        Throughout its interventions, the JPGE will engage in                 capacity-strengthening at macro, meso and micro levels.</narrative>
  </description>
